  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Yes, standard homeowners insurance policies in Utah typically cover hail damage to your roof, siding, and other physical structures."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What is Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dwelling Coverage: Pays to repair or replace your home's physical structure, including the roof, gutters, and siding damaged by hail."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Other Structures: Covers detached structures on your property like fences, sheds, or detached garages."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Personal Property: Protects your belongings if hail breaks a window or damages items kept outside (like patio furniture)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Important Details to Check"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Your Deductible: You must pay your out-of-pocket deductible before your insurance kicks in. Some policies in high-risk areas have a separate, higher percentage deductible specifically for wind and hail damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cosmetic Exclusions: Some insurers exclude \"cosmetic\" damage (like minor dents that do not cause leaks or affect the function of your roof or siding). Review your specific policy to see if functional impairment is required for a payout."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Filing Guidance: You can review general claim tips from the Utah Insurance Department before filing.",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Utah Insurance Department",
                "link": "https://insurance.utah.gov/consumers/home-insurance/home-claims-info/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "The name of your insurance provider"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you are looking at roof or siding damage"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you understand what questions to ask your agent or what steps to take next."
      },
